  "published": "2026-11-27T16:10:32.55Z",
  "readmeFile": "README.md",
  "releaseNotes": "# Changelog 0.1.12\n\n## Changes since 0.1.0\n\n- Isolate banked sound drivers, bound silence probing and match PAL hints (`6f395c8`)\n- Probe direct sound routines when RAM queues find no music (`71bebda`)\n- Discover banked sound dispatchers and sentinel ring-buffer queues (`7889897`)\n- Name tracks from vgmrips.net packs and effects from built-in profiles (#17) (`4b57b84`)\n- Make captures independent of what ran before them (#15) (`5ebb077`)\n- End sounds that outlast the reference when the idle driver's writes vary between frames (#14) (`7e93f3c`)\n- Name SMB2 tracks correctly and end sounds that outlast the reference (#10) (`88f9284`)\n- Write NES DMC samples into the VGM (#9) (`3c214a7`)\n- Add an agent guide (#6) (`953ae00`)\n- Rename the package to SoulRipper.Tool and the command to soulripper (#5) (`c2e1d05`)\n- Write gzipped .vgz by default (#4) (`8734e7d`)\n- End effects when they stop being heard (#3) (`c5b0a1a`)\n",
